# Angular

- Use modern template control flow (`@if`, `@for`) and standalone imports.
- Prefer `inject()` and signals for concise, typed component code.
- Keep `ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on application components.
- Use Angular CLI scripts for serve, test, and build.
- Preserve accessibility with semantic HTML, labels, keyboard support, and visible focus.
- Avoid NgModules and manual change detection unless integration constraints require them.
